<title>USA: Oscar nominations for best foreign film.</title>
<headline>Oscar nominations for best foreign film.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Academy Award nominations on Tuesday for best foreign film were &quot;Kolya&quot; from the Czech Republic, &quot;Prisoner of the Mountains&quot; from Russia, &quot;Ridicule&quot; from France, &quot;The Other Side of Sunday&quot; from Norway, &quot;A Chef in Love&quot; from Georgia.</p>
</text>
